          <groundspeak:finder id="4883787">Kottbullar</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP258 Calgary- Riley Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I knew a good spot to park from when I worked in this area and walked to this cap and the one up on Crescent Rd. Jaywalked (shhhh...) across 10th and made a quick find right by a blue flag. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="682478765">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-26T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3061435">Iron Phoenix</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP258 - Riley Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I managed to convince One Bad Ant that with the impending doom.... er, I mean, the upcoming change in logging rules, that we should do a blitz of Brass Caps.  I think I've been to this one before, but probably early in my capping days, so didn't have any luck then.  Nice to find it today!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; As others have mentioned, it has been pretty battered. &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_sad.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="681684370">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-26T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="540154">One Bad Ant</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP258 Riley Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap. They are everywhere once you start looking :) Turn left at the first blooming tulip of the season!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="681175924">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-04-22T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP258 - Calgary - Riley Park

&lt;strong&gt;Posted:&lt;/strong&gt; N51° 03.576' W114° 05.167'

&lt;strong&gt;My GPSr:&lt;/strong&gt; N51° 03.577' W114° 05.170'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I parked in the nearby parking lot and I have to say it's the first time in my life I've seen a cricket batting cage. After a short walk to gz I found the cap beside a handy flag marking the spot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
