          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP258 Calgary - Riley Park&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#32 of 46 caps found on the day.  I spent the early morning finding caps at all points from Calgary to Red Deer.  I returned to Calgary in the afternoon to clear out much of north Calgary including a good hike across nose hill.  TFTC&lt;/p&gt;

